# Line-ending policy for generated artifacts.
#
# `crates/do-harness/tests/completions_sync.rs` byte-compares the committed
# completions against what the CLI generates, and the generator always emits LF.
# Without this rule a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites them to
# CRLF, so the guard would fail for a reason that has nothing to do with the
# artifact's content.
completions/* text eol=lf
